ou're gearing solo — usually dropped at full endgame DPS.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Future Perfect","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Weapon kills grant +1 skill tier for 15s (stacks to 3); kills at tier 6 grant Overcharge.","w":"Strong on skill-tier builds — irrelevant to weapon-damage builds.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Sledgehammer","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Grenade damage marks targets; marked enemies take +30% armour damage and move slower.","w":"Niche armour-shred utility. Not a general DPS pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Steady Handed","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Hits stack +1% accuracy & stability; at 100 stacks consumes them to refill the mag.","w":"Light utility, mostly for hard-to-control weapons. Not a damage pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Close & Personal","v":"sit","d":"All weapons. Killing a target within 7m grants +30% weapon damage for 10s.","w":"Risky at high difficulty; aggressive close-range only.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Naked","v":"skip","d":"Marksman Rifles. While your armour is depleted, gain +50% headshot damage for 5s.","w":"Needs you to play at zero armour — too risky for general PvE.","scope":"class"}]},{"id":"Pistol","name":"Pistol","tag":"Sidearm · swap-DPS or standalone","attrs":[{"name":"Critical Hit Chance","note":"For Determined-style headshot chaining or a swap-DPS loop with Finisher."},{"name":"Critical Hit Damage","note":"Pairs with chance for burst windows after a weapon swap."},{"name":"Weapon Handling","note":"Faster swap speed if you’re using the pistol as a finisher rather than a main."}],"talents":[{"n":"Determined","v":"keep","d":"Rifles / MMR / Pistols. After a headshot kill, your next shot on any enemy is a guaranteed headshot.","w":"Excellent for headshot/rifle builds — turns body shots into heads to keep the chain going.","scope":"class"},{"n":"Optimist","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. +3% weapon damage for every 10% of ammo missing from the magazine.","w":"Core DPS talent. Best on high-capacity LMGs, ARs and rifles.","