ed enemies; after 3 kills, applies pulse to the next enemy you hit.","w":"Pulse-status synergy (pairs with Spotter / skill builds). Off-build for crit.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Vindictive","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Killing a status-afflicted enemy grants you and allies in 15m +15% crit chance & crit damage for 20s.","w":"Excellent in groups or status builds. Solo it still buffs you, but needs a status source.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Sadist","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to bleeding enemies; applies bleed after 4 kills.","w":"Status-build synergy. Off a crit build it's filler.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Ignited","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to burning enemies; applies burn after 4 kills.","w":"Good with fire/skill (incendiary) builds. Otherwise skip.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Eyeless","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to blinded enemies; applies blind after 4 kills.","w":"Niche — needs a blind source or the self-apply to matter.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Spike","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots grant +20% skill damage for 15s.","w":"Skill-build only. Dead on a weapon-damage build.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Perpetuation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots boost the damage & duration of your next status effect (+50%).","w":"Niche status / skill sustain.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Reformation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots grant +30% skill repair for 15s.","w":"Healer / support skill builds only.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Preservation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Kills repair 10% armour over 5s; headshot kills repair an extra 10%.","w":"Handy survivability while you're gearing solo — usually dropped at full endgame DPS.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Future Perfect","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Weapon kills grant +1 skill tier for 15s (stacks to 3); kills at tier 6 grant Overcharge.","w":"Strong on skill-tier builds — irrelevant to weapon-damage builds.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Sledgehammer","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Grenade damage marks targets; marked enemies take +30% armour damage and move slower.","w":"Niche armour-shred utility. Not a general DPS pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Steady Handed","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Hits stack +1% accuracy & stability; at 100 stacks consumes them to refill the mag.","w":"Light utility, mostly for hard-to-control weapons. Not a damage pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Close & Personal","v":"sit","d":"All weapons. Killing a target within 7m grants +30% weapon damage for 10s.","w":"Risky at high difficulty; aggressive close-range only.","scope":"universal"}]},{"id":"Shotgun","name":"Shotgun","tag":"Point-blank · pellet spread","attrs":[{"name":"Weapon Damage","note":"Pellet spread makes crit rolls inconsistent — flat damage is the more reliable investment."},{"name":"Reload Speed","note":"Low mag size means you’re reloading constantly; Pumped Up and Pummel both reward it."},{"name":"Optimal Range","note":"Stretches the very short effective range just enough to matter."}],"talents":[{"n":"Optimist","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. +3% weapon damage for every 10% of ammo missing from the magazine.","w":"Core DPS talent. Best on high-capacity LMGs, ARs and rifles.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Killer","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. Killing with a critical hit grants +40% critical hit damage for 10s.","w":"Pure crit-DPS gain. Pairs with any high-CHC build — the Striker/St. Elmo's staple.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Ranger","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. +2% weapon damage for every 5m of distance to the target.","w":"Strong AR / rifle DPS for ranged solo play. Easy uptime at distance.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Breadbasket","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. Body shots stack bonus headshot damage onto your next headshot (up to 3 stacks).","w":"Big for headshot builds — especially on full-auto where heads are hard to land. Off-build for pure crit.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Strained","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. +10% critical hit damage for every 0.5s of continuous fire, stacks up to 5.","w":"Strong sustained crit-damage on automatics. Wants high crit chance to pay off.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Fast Hands","v":"keep","d":"Any weapon. Critical hits stack a +4% reload-speed bonus (max 40%).","w":"Utility that keeps LMGs/ARs firing. Pairs naturally with Killer/crit builds.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Pummel","v":"sit","d":"Shotguns. Three consecutive kills refill the mag and grant +40% weapon damage for 10s.","w":"Shotgun-build payoff; needs the kill streak to fire.","scope":"class"},{"n":"Pumped Up","v":"sit","d":"Shotguns. Each reload stacks +1% weapon damage for 10s (up to 25).","w":"Ramp-up shotgun talent. Slow to build, shotgun-only.","scope":"class"},{"n":"In Sync","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Hitting an enemy grants +15% skill damage; using a skill (or hitting with one) grants +15% weapon damage.","w":"Excellent on hybrid / skill-DPS builds. Dead weight on a pure red build.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Flatline","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +15% weapon damage to pulsed enemies; after 3 kills, applies pulse to the next enemy you hit.","w":"Pulse-status synergy (pairs with Spotter / skill builds). Off-build for crit.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Vindictive","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Killing a status-afflicted enemy grants you and allies in 15m +15% crit chance & crit damage for 20s.","w":"Excellent in groups or status builds. Solo it still buffs you, but needs a status source.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Sadist","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to bleeding enemies; applies bleed after 4 kills.","w":"Status-build synergy. Off a crit build it's filler.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Ignited","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to burning enemies; applies burn after 4 kills.","w":"Good with fire/skill (incendiary) builds. Otherwise skip.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Eyeless","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. +20% weapon damage to blinded enemies; applies blind after 4 kills.","w":"Niche — needs a blind source or the self-apply to matter.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Spike","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots grant +20% skill damage for 15s.","w":"Skill-build only. Dead on a weapon-damage build.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Perpetuation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots boost the damage & duration of your next status effect (+50%).","w":"Niche status / skill sustain.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Reformation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Headshots grant +30% skill repair for 15s.","w":"Healer / support skill builds only.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Preservation","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Kills repair 10% armour over 5s; headshot kills repair an extra 10%.","w":"Handy survivability while you're gearing solo — usually dropped at full endgame DPS.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Future Perfect","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Weapon kills grant +1 skill tier for 15s (stacks to 3); kills at tier 6 grant Overcharge.","w":"Strong on skill-tier builds — irrelevant to weapon-damage builds.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Sledgehammer","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Grenade damage marks targets; marked enemies take +30% armour damage and move slower.","w":"Niche armour-shred utility. Not a general DPS pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Steady Handed","v":"sit","d":"Any weapon. Hits stack +1% accuracy & stability; at 100 stacks consumes them to refill the mag.","w":"Light utility, mostly for hard-to-control weapons. Not a damage pick.","scope":"universal"},{"n":"Close & Personal","v":"sit","d":"All weapons. Killing a target within 7m grants +30% weapon damage for 10s.","w":"Risky at high difficulty; aggressive close-range only.","scope":"universal"}]}]$seed$::jsonb, true, 'seed')
